  contentList:
  - I hope you are having a great day at the North Pole!  Could you please send me
    a new Car? Cheers.
  - I hope you are having a great day at the North Pole!  If possible, I would love
    a shiny new vehicle to race around with. It would make my adventures even more
    exciting. Cheers, Santa.
  - "I hope you are having a great day at the North Pole!  I\u2019m wishing for something
    with wheels that can take me far, even if it fits in my hands."
